

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  <type>(<scope>): <imperative summary>
#
#  - concrete change
#  - concrete change
#
#  Why: one or two sentences of rationale.   <-- REQUIRED
#  Refs: learning.md R4                      <-- optional
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
#  TYPES
#    feat      new capability
#    fix       correcting broken behaviour
#    docs      documentation only
#    refactor  restructuring, no behaviour change
#    chore     tooling, config, dependencies
#    style     formatting or CSS only
#    revert    undoing a previous commit
#
#  SCOPES
#    repo  env  docs  history  theme  tokens  cpt  acf
#    template  header  footer  page  export
#
#  SUBJECT LINE
#    imperative mood — "add", not "added" / "adds"
#    lowercase after the colon
#    no trailing full stop
#    50 characters maximum
#
#  BODY
#    wrap at 72 characters
#    "Why:" is required — it is what makes git log useful
#    in a year, and is greppable: git log --grep="^Why:"
#
#  NEVER INCLUDE
#    personal names or email addresses
#    Co-Authored-By: trailers
#    Signed-off-by: trailers
#    any AI or tool attribution ("generated with", etc.)
#
#  CYCLE DISCIPLINE
#    README.md and project_history.md updates ship in the
#    SAME commit as the change they describe.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
